gr-dspira preserves source and generated scaffolding from several historical
GNU Radio prototypes. Rights and attribution remain with their respective
holders as stated in the individual files and commit history.

An archival review found GNU GPL notices in 87 historical files. Their headers
include 78 Free Software Foundation copyright statements and nine Python files
with the original "<+YOU OR YOUR COMPANY+>" template placeholder. The GPL-3.0
text in LICENSE is provided for reference; it does not replace file-level
notices or assign ownership where the old scaffolding did not do so.
